### Frontend: Planner Page

#### [NEW] [page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/planner/page.tsx)
Main planner page with three-panel layout:
- **Left panel (Backlog)**: Fetches `GET /tasks?status=inbox`, displays as a draggable card list. Includes "Sort Stack" button to open Gauntlet (Phase 2, placeholder button for now).
- **Center panel (Timeline)**: Reuses timetable fetch logic (`GET /timetable/week`). Renders class slots (solid), task chips (colored dots on due dates), and Ghost Slots (semi-transparent, from `GET /timetable/ai-plan`). Ghost Slots have a "Solidify" button that calls `POST /timetable/events` + `POST /companion/exp`.
- **Right panel (Companion)**: Displays the 8-bit sprite, mood, level, streak, and a one-line "brief" from the companion.

#### [NEW] [CompanionSprite.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionSprite.tsx)
Pure presentational component. Renders a CSS pixel art sprite based on `archetype` and `mood` props.
- Uses a `canvas` element or CSS `box-shadow` technique for the 8-bit look.
- Each archetype has 4 mood frames: happy, neutral, sleepy, zen.
- Small idle animation (gentle bob) via CSS keyframes.

#### [NEW] [CompanionPanel.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx)
Right sidebar component:
- Fetches `GET /companion/state` on mount.
- Displays: sprite, mood label, level, EXP bar, streak counter.
- One-line contextual message based on mood (e.g., "Ready to study!" / "The backlog is growing...").

#### [NEW] [GhostSlot.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/planner/GhostSlot.tsx)
A timetable cell variant rendered at `opacity: 0.4` with a dashed border and a "✓ Commit" button overlay. On commit, calls the API and transitions to a solid block.

#### [MODIFY] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx)
Add a new nav item in the `planning` group:
```tsx
{ href: '/planner', icon: Sparkles, label: 'Planner' }
```

