## Phase 2: Polish — Gamification & Delight

*(Not implemented in Phase 1, but designed for follow-up)*

### Sorting Gauntlet
- New component `SortingGauntlet.tsx`: A modal with a card stack. User taps "Today" / "Later" / "Auto" per card.
- Backend: `POST /companion/gauntlet` endpoint that batch-processes decisions.

### Streak Tracking
- Auto check-in on page load via `POST /companion/streak`.
- Visual "flame" CSS animation at streak milestones (7, 14, 30 days).

### Evening Reflection
- New component `EveningReflection.tsx`: A modal with a single AI-generated question.
- Backend: `POST /companion/reflection` stores response and awards EXP.

### Environmental Storytelling
- CSS weather filter overlay on the timeline (golden glow at high streak, subtle rain at low).

